    "title": "Severe Thunderstorm Warning by NWS - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Check NWS updates here SVREAX The National Weather Service in Pleasant Hill has issued a * Severe Thunderstorm Warning for... Central Henry County in west central Missouri... * Until 1100 PM CDT. * At 1030 PM CDT, a severe thunderstorm was located 7 miles northwest of Clinton, moving east at 40 mph. HAZARD...60 mph wind gusts. SOURCE...Radar indicated. IMPACT...Expect damage to roofs, siding, and trees. * Locations impacted include... Clinton, Calhoun, Coal, Tightwad, Hartwell, and Truman Lake.",
